<title>PAKISTAN: Cricket-Pakistan 269-2 v New Zealand (249) - close.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Pakistan 269-2 v New Zealand (249) - close.</headline>
<dateline>RAWALPINDI, Pakistan 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan, replying to New Zealand's first innings score of 249, were 269 for two at the close on the second day of the second test on Friday.</p>
</text>
